          Choose the way you would like to receive updates from us.
        </p>

        <form id="notification-form">
          <div class="form-field">
            <fieldset>
              <legend>How do you prefer to receive notifications?</legend>
              <div class="choices">
                <div class="choice">
                  <input id="notification-email" name="notification" type="radio" value="Email" required />
                  <label for="notification-email">Email</label>
                </div>
                <div class="choice">
                  <input id="notification-sms" name="notification" type="radio" value="SMS" />
